@romancode001 that's unrelated to this change. While it changes the way we iterate initially (pairs in parallel vs. timerange in parallel) - rate-limits didn't change in this Pull Request.

RateLimit settings however change in ccxt from time to time (i'm not aware of recent changes to okx - but i'm not following every line in ccxt, either).

A quick search reveals that apparently only a couple days ago, ccxt noticed the same (https://github.com/ccxt/ccxt/pull/26973) - so i guess with a more recent ccxt update, this will solve itself.

